arration","group":"source-use","neighbours":["great-noon"],"line":{"ru":"Позднее пробуждение открывает учителю новую истину.","en":"A late awakening opens a new truth to the teacher."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"I.02","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-a590b524693bb058d30f6d26cdc7270f","tos.text-unit.sid-a590b524693bb058d30f6d26cdc7270f"]},"form":"thun","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"","mode":"speech","use":"question","group":"source-use","neighbours":["courage","zarathustra","camel"],"line":{"ru":"Тяжесть духа — унизиться, чтобы заставить страдать своё высокомерие.","en":"The spirit’s burden is to humble oneself in order to make one’s pride suffer."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"I.03","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-ff639bab5bd37a718038c52c25fafd4c","tos.text-unit.sid-ff639bab5bd37a718038c52c25fafd4c"]},"form":"thut","speaker":"sleep-sage","addressee":"young-listeners","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"source-use","neighbours":["necessity","sleep-sage"],"line":{"ru":"Мудрец сна требует бодрствующей подготовки ко сну.","en":"The sleep sage demands wakeful preparation for sleep."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"I.03","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-ef7c779fc1bafecaa0c21304580f7653","tos.text-unit.sid-ef7c779fc1bafecaa0c21304580f7653"]},"form":"gethan","speaker":"sleep-sage","addressee":"young-listeners","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"source-use","neighbours":["identity","sleep-sage"]},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"I.03","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-3467d2365f4b8f250d7246166cae667f","tos.text-unit.sid-3467d2365f4b8f250d7246166cae667f"]},"form":"that","speaker":"sleep-sage","addressee":"young-listeners","mode":"speech","use":"question","group":"source-use","neighbours":["laughter","sleep-sage"]},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"I.05","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-13e7af8a5fba9b3952c7257a555f9ebd","tos.text-unit.sid-13e7af8a5fba9b3952c7257a555f9ebd"]},"form":"thut","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"source-use","neighbours":["will","body-self","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Тело с его большим разумом делает «я».","en":"The body’s great reason enacts the I."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"I.06","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-a6eb17f61e81d70b5f91d57eed9d46d2","tos.text-unit.sid-a6eb17f61e81d70b5f91d57eed9d46d2"]},"form":"thätest","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"source-use","neighbours":["zarathustra","imagined-brother"]},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"I.07","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-dc12dbaaa6316b0cb3d0e6b57aacd3b7","tos.text-unit.sid-dc12dbaaa6316b0cb3d0e6b57aacd3b7"]},"form":"gethan","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"judges","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"source-use","neighbours":["will","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Судья поставлен перед собственными мысленными поступками.","en":"The judge is confronted with deeds committed in thought."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"I.07","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-5658f7bfe9abcc9db9afa7e976efe470","tos.text-unit.sid-70daeeff7183c5e505ba8ad61cb69a66"]},"form":"That","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"judges","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"source-use","neighbours":["identity","difference","wheel","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Образ совершённого дела мучает того, кто вынес само дело.","en":"The image of the completed deed torments the one who bore the deed itself."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"I.07","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-afad86c15ab4e74c2ab8f89cb0679e63","tos.text-unit.sid-afad86c15ab4e74c2ab8f89cb0679e63"]},"form":"That","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"judges","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"source-use","neighbours":["zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Для преступника одно совершённое дело стало исключением, превратившимся в его существо.","en":"For the criminal, one deed became the exception that turned into his being."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"I.07","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-51481e45ced8cb496e04af123563251b","tos.text-unit.sid-51481e45ced8cb496e04af123563251b"]},"form":"That","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"judges","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"source-use","neighbours":["zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Нанесённый удар околдовывает разум после дела.","en":"The blow he struck bewitches his reason after the deed."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"I.07","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-26ba689c475c37fc8821b90735e0aaf3","tos.text-unit.sid-26ba689c475c37fc8821b90735e0aaf3"]},"form":"That","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"judges","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"source-use","neighbours":["difference","attention","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Учитель призывает судей глубже проникнуть в душу и понять безумие перед делом.","en":"The teacher urges the judges to look deeper into the soul and understand the madness before the deed."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"I.07","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-a9300cabdc938d07497d4fdcddd89923","tos.text-unit.sid-a9300cabdc938d07497d4fdcddd89923"]},"form":"thun","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"judges","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"source-use","neighbours":["will","becoming","zarathustra"]},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"I.08","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-5a1691d5125223146f1fc86072b4a59a","tos.text-unit.sid-5a1691d5125223146f1fc86072b4a59a"]},"form":"thut","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"source-use","neighbours":["becoming","identity","zarathustra"]},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"I.08","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-1c69119d581baf73f01e94810e6f47ab","tos.text-unit.sid-1c69119d581baf73f01e94810e6f47ab"]},"form":"thut","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"","mode":"speech","use":"teaching","group":"source-use","neighbours":["zarathustra"]},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"I.10","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-b928916c29c8820604e6c175bb9042c8","tos.text-unit.sid-b9